      "text": "Now let me look at each ticket. The bugs in `paths.py`, `retry.py`, `router.py`, and `format.py` are fairly clear. Before implementing the open-ended guardrails ticket, let me run the eval suite once to see the baseline and learn what behavior is expected.",
