      "text": "The eval confirms my diagnosis. The 16 failures map exactly to the four bug tickets:\n\n- **#215** (t02, t09, t10, t29): relative paths resolved against cwd (`/repo`) instead of `/srv/quillpath`\n- **#223** (t12, t19, t23, t36): docs/dependency requests route to `unknown` — the `docs_update`/`dependency_info` patterns contain uppercase letters but the text is lowercased before matching, so they can never match\n- **#219** (t14, t15, t21, t28): `ConnectionError: 503` from `http.get` isn't retried\n- **#224** (t22, t26, t30, t35): `UnicodeEncodeError` on names like \"Amélie Fournier\"\n\nA key observation for #212: the other 20 tasks pass with the allow-everything stub, so my guardrails must keep all legitimate in-scope operations autonomous — containment is the right guardrail, not per-operation approval gates.\n\nLet me implement all five fixes.",
